  "name": "Roman Ceresnak",
  "created_at": "2026-10-21T05:25:47+00:00",
  "likes": 2,
  "text": "Great article! I really appreciate the practical, evidence-based approach to demonstrating how AgentCore Memory works in real-world scenarios. The distinction between short-term and long-term memory, actor-level isolation, and especially the asynchronous extraction delays are valuable insights. It's great to see not just what works, but also the pitfalls and lessons learned during implementation. Thanks for sharing!"
 },
